  "solution": {
    "text": "Equation of the tangent at <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> on the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />Let equation of circle touching line <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math> at <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> which passes through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> <math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>Equation of the required circle is <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math>&nbsp;The radius of the circle is <math><msqrt><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>24</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>",
